\q2 \rb and a bribe|מַתָּנָֽה׃\rb* \rb corrupts|וִֽיאַבֵּ֥ד\rb* \rb the heart|לֵ֖ב\rb*.
\q1 \v 8 \rb The end|אַחֲרִ֥ית\rb* \rb of a matter|דָּבָ֖ר\rb* \rb is better|ט֛וֹב\rb* \rb than the beginning|מֵֽרֵאשִׁית֑וֹ\rb*,
\q2 \rb and a patient|אֶֽרֶךְ־\rb* \rb spirit|ר֖וּחַ\rb* \rb is better|ט֥וֹב\rb* \rb than a proud|מִגְּבַהּ־\rb* \rb one|רֽוּחַ׃\rb*.
\b 
\q1 \v 9 \rb Do not|אַל־\rb* \rb be quickly|תְּבַהֵ֥ל\rb* \rb provoked|לִכְע֑וֹס\rb* \rb in your spirit|בְּרֽוּחֲךָ֖\rb*,
\q2 \rb for|כִּ֣י\rb* \rb anger|כַ֔עַס\rb* \rb settles|יָנֽוּחַ׃\rb* \rb in the lap|בְּחֵ֥יק\rb* \rb of a fool|כְּסִילִ֖ים\rb*.\f + \fr 7:9 \ft Hebrew \fqa in the bosom of fools\f*
