\q1 \v 14 \rb In the day|בְּי֤וֹם\rb* \rb of prosperity|טוֹבָה֙\rb*, \rb be|הֱיֵ֣ה\rb* \rb joyful|בְט֔וֹב\rb*,
\q2 \rb but in the day|וּבְי֥וֹם\rb* \rb of adversity|רָעָ֖ה\rb*, \rb consider this|רְאֵ֑ה\rb*\rb |גַּ֣ם\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb*:
