\s1 The Limits of Human Wisdom
\p \v 15 \rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb In my futile|הֶבְלִ֑י\rb* \rb life|בִּימֵ֣י\rb* \rb I have seen|רָאִ֖יתִי\rb* \rb both of these|הַכֹּ֥ל\rb*:
