\q1 \v 6 \rb Remember Him before|עַ֣ד\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֤ר\rb*\rb |לֹֽא־\rb* \rb the silver|הַכֶּ֔סֶף\rb* \rb cord|חֶ֣בֶל\rb* \rb is snapped|יִרְחַק\rb*
\q2 \rb and the golden|הַזָּהָ֑ב\rb* \rb bowl|גֻּלַּ֣ת\rb* \rb is crushed|וְתָרֻ֖ץ\rb*,
\q1 \rb before the pitcher|כַּד֙\rb* \rb is shattered|וְתִשָּׁ֤בֶר\rb* \rb at|עַל־\rb* \rb the spring|הַמַּבּ֔וּעַ\rb*
\q2 \rb and the wheel|הַגַּלְגַּ֖ל\rb* \rb is broken|וְנָרֹ֥ץ\rb* \rb at|אֶל־\rb* \rb the well|הַבּֽוֹר׃\rb*,
\q1 \v 7 \rb before the dust|הֶעָפָ֛ר\rb* \rb returns|וְיָשֹׁ֧ב\rb* \rb to|עַל־\rb* \rb the ground|הָאָ֖רֶץ\rb* \rb from which it came|כְּשֶׁהָיָ֑ה\rb*
\q2 \rb and the spirit|וְהָר֣וּחַ\rb* \rb returns|תָּשׁ֔וּב\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb God|הָאֱלֹהִ֖ים\rb* \rb who|אֲשֶׁ֥ר\rb* \rb gave it|נְתָנָֽהּ׃\rb*.
\b 
\q1 \v 8 “\rb Futility|הֲבֵ֧ל\rb* \rb of futilities|הֲבָלִ֛ים\rb*,” \rb says|אָמַ֥ר\rb* \rb the Teacher|הַקּוֹהֶ֖לֶת\rb*.
\q2 “\rb Everything|הַכֹּ֥ל\rb* \rb is futile|הָֽבֶל׃\rb*!”
\s1 The Whole Duty of Man
\p \v 9 \rb Not only|וְיֹתֵ֕ר\rb* \rb was|שֶׁהָיָ֥ה\rb* \rb the Teacher|קֹהֶ֖לֶת\rb* \rb wise|חָכָ֑ם\rb*, \rb but he also|ע֗וֹד\rb* \rb taught|לִמַּד־\rb* \rb the people|הָעָ֔ם\rb* \rb knowledge|דַּ֙עַת֙\rb*;\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb he pondered|וְאִזֵּ֣ן\rb*, \rb searched out|וְחִקֵּ֔ר\rb*, \rb and arranged|תִּקֵּ֖ן\rb* \rb many|הַרְבֵּֽה׃\rb* \rb proverbs|מְשָׁלִ֥ים\rb*. \v 10 \rb The Teacher|קֹהֶ֔לֶת\rb* \rb searched|בִּקֵּ֣שׁ\rb* \rb to find|לִמְצֹ֖א\rb* \rb delightful|חֵ֑פֶץ\rb* \rb sayings|דִּבְרֵי־\rb* \rb and to record|וְכָת֥וּב\rb* \rb accurate|יֹ֖שֶׁר\rb* \rb words|דִּבְרֵ֥י\rb* \rb of truth|אֱמֶֽת׃\rb*.\f + \fr 12:10 \ft Or \fqa and sought to write what was upright and true\f*
\p \v 11 \rb The words|דִּבְרֵ֤י\rb* \rb of the wise|חֲכָמִים֙\rb* \rb are like goads|כַּדָּ֣רְבֹנ֔וֹת\rb*, \rb and the anthologies|אֲסֻפּ֑וֹת\rb* \rb of the masters|בַּעֲלֵ֣י\rb* \rb are like firmly embedded|נְטוּעִ֖ים\rb* \rb nails|וּֽכְמַשְׂמְר֥וֹת\rb* \rb driven|נִתְּנ֖וּ\rb* \rb by a single|אֶחָֽד׃\rb* \rb Shepherd|מֵרֹעֶ֥ה\rb*.\f + \fr 12:11 \ft Or \fqa shepherd\f* \v 12 \rb And by these|מֵהֵ֖מָּה\rb*, \rb my son|בְּנִ֣י\rb*, \rb be further|וְיֹתֵ֥ר\rb* \rb warned|הִזָּהֵ֑ר\rb*: \rb There is no|אֵ֣ין\rb* \rb end|קֵ֔ץ\rb* \rb to the making|עֲשׂ֨וֹת\rb* \rb of many|הַרְבֵּה֙\rb* \rb books|סְפָרִ֤ים\rb*, \rb and much|הַרְבֵּ֖ה\rb* \rb study|וְלַ֥הַג\rb* \rb wearies|יְגִעַ֥ת\rb* \rb the body|בָּשָֽׂר׃\rb*.
\p \v 13 \rb When all|הַכֹּ֣ל\rb* \rb has been heard|נִשְׁמָ֑ע\rb*,\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the conclusion|ס֥וֹף\rb* \rb of the matter is this|דָּבָ֖ר\rb*: \rb Fear|יְרָא֙\rb* \rb God|הָאֱלֹהִ֤ים\rb* \rb and|וְאֶת־\rb* \rb keep|שְׁמ֔וֹר\rb* \rb His commandments|מִצְוֺתָ֣יו\rb*, \rb because|כִּי־\rb* \rb this is|זֶ֖ה\rb* \rb the whole duty|כָּל־\rb* \rb of man|הָאָדָֽם׃\rb*. \v 14 \rb For|כִּ֤י\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb God|הָאֱלֹהִ֛ים\rb* \rb will bring|יָבִ֥א\rb* \rb every|כָּל־\rb* \rb deed|מַֽעֲשֶׂ֔ה\rb* \rb into judgment|בְמִשְׁפָּ֖ט\rb*, \rb along with|עַ֣ל\rb* \rb every hidden|נֶעְלָ֑ם\rb* \rb thing|כָּל־\rb*, \rb whether|אִם־\rb* \rb good|ט֖וֹב\rb* \rb or|וְאִם־\rb* \rb evil|רָֽע׃\rb*.
